0..61 Comment "//! `SpecificationMonad` states an ordered monad as a theory."
62..65 Comment "//!"
66..146 Comment "//! Its computations have an order. Its extension is monotone in both arguments."
147..220 Comment "//! An operation lands in a sort. The order indexes two computations. Its"
221..270 Comment "//! evidence is a term that the operations build."
271..274 Comment "//!"
275..335 Comment "//! The twin refuses the monad laws beside the indexed sort."
336..339 Comment "//!"
340..356 Comment "//! - see: #4128"
357..405 Comment "//! - cites: [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all]"
406..521 Comment "//! [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all]: https://doi.org/10.1145/3341708 \"Maillard et al., Dijkstra Monads for All\""
523..586 Comment "/// `SpecificationMonad` has values, computations and an order."
587..655 Comment "/// The order is reflexive, transitive and monotone under extension."
